long as it's long into the future. The anime can be set in an alternative universe not tied with our own, as long as it has a futuristic feel to it.This category sports quite a lot of anime, mostly stemming from SciFi, but not necessarily only from there.","totalMediaCount":776,"slug":"future","nsfw":false,"childCount":0},"relationships":{"parent":{"links":{"self":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/50/relationships/parent","related":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/50/parent"}},"anime":{"links":{"self":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/50/relationships/anime","related":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/50/anime"}},"drama":{"links":{"self":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/50/relationships/drama","related":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/50/drama"}},"manga":{"links":{"self":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/50/relationships/manga","related":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/50/manga"}}}},{"id":"73","type":"categories","links":{"self":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/73"},"attributes":{"createdAt":"2017-05-31T06:38:50.058Z","updatedAt":"2021-10-02T01:30:59.225Z","title":"Slapstick","description":"Slapstick humour is generally recognized by lots of physical abuse, horseplay and practical jokes. Also often seen are impossible situations, using sounds to illustrate impossible stunts that aren't shown on-screen and to create tension for audience anticipation.","totalMediaCount":496,"slug":"slapstick","nsfw":false,"childCount":1},"relationships":{"parent":{"links":{"self":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/73/relationships/parent","related":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/73/parent"}},"anime":{"links":{"self":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/73/relationships/anime","related":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/73/anime"}},"drama":{"links":{"self":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/73/relationships/drama","related":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/73/drama"}},"manga":{"links":{"self":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/73/relationships/manga","related":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/73/manga"}}}},{"id":"183","type":"categories","links":{"self":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/183"},"attributes":{"createdAt":"2017-05-31T06:39:28.330Z","updatedAt":"2021-10-02T01:31:02.116Z","title":"Law And Order","description":"Where there is \"wealth\", there are criminals. It is up to the civil law enforcement, i.e. detectives, Police or Special Squads, to keep the lawless activities in the real world or in cyberspace under control.\n\nNote: Do not confuse this with Military presence.","totalMediaCount":166,"slug":"law-and-order","nsfw":false,"childCount":2},"relationships":{"parent":{"links":{"self":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/183/relationships/parent","related":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/183/parent"}},"anime":{"links":{"self":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/183/relationships/anime","related":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/183/anime"}},"drama":{"links":{"self":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/183/relationships/drama","related":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/183/drama"}},"manga":{"links":{"self":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/183/relationships/manga","related":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/183/manga"}}}},{"id":"108","type":"categories","links":{"self":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/108"},"attributes":{"createdAt":"2017-05-31T06:39:04.202Z","updatedAt":"2021-10-02T01:30:58.265Z","title":"Violence","description":"Physical force against self or other, compelling action against one's will on pain of being hurt.","totalMediaCount":1400,"slug":"violence","nsfw":false,"childCount":0},"relationships":{"parent":{"links":{"self":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/108/relationships/parent","related":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/108/parent"}},"anime":{"links":{"self":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/108/relationships/anime","related":"https://kitsu.io/api/edge/categories/108/anime"}},"drama":{"links":{"